# Per-cell raw NCU sidecars from sweep_repeatability_matrix.py runs.
# The verdict-table.csv + verdict.json + manifests/ + comparison/ artifacts
# at the sweep root are committed; the per-cell raw sidecar trees
# (one folder per cohort cell, each holding ~40 .ncu-rep + .json files)
# are reproducible from the manifests + the binary/trace state at the
# sweep_id's HEAD. Excluding them keeps the committed footprint small
# while preserving the headline artifacts a Codex review needs.
#
# IMPORTANT: the per-cell-per-config _aggregator_out/ subdirectory
# (typically 3 small JSON files: label_admitted.json,
# label_excluded.json, label_repeatability.json) is NOT in the
# ignore list — the offline selector tool
# tools/local_labels/select_best_config_labels.py walks those
# files to rederive the committed selected corpus + verify the
# source_sha256 audit trail. The narrow patterns below target
# only the volume offenders (raw .ncu-rep + per-launch JSONs)
# under cell=*/cfg=*/ so _aggregator_out/ stays trackable.
data/local_labels/sweeps/**/cell=*/cfg=*/**/*.ncu-rep
data/local_labels/sweeps/**/cell=*/cfg=*/**/label_*_*.json

# Per-launch NCU sidecars produced by tools/local_labels/label_driver.sh
# directly under data/local_labels/<device>/<slug>/<shape_point>/.
# The .ncu-rep files are raw NCU profile dumps (multi-MB each) and
# the per-launch label_*_*.json + label_run_manifest_*_*.json
# sidecars are host-local evidence; the canonical aggregate lives at
# data/local_labels/label_admitted.json and is the project's
# source-of-truth. The narrow patterns below target the post-R20
# trace_l2_accuracy_xl labeling-cycle output without touching the
# pre-existing tracked gemm_hmma_bf16_sm80/correctness_shape/
# sidecars (already in the index; .gitignore does not untrack).
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/trace_l2_accuracy_xl/*.ncu-rep
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/trace_l2_accuracy_xl/label_*_*.json
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/trace_l2_accuracy_xl/label_run_manifest_*_*.json
# Same per-launch sidecar pattern for the attention_conv portable_lcd
# slugs that label at timing_shape (rather than trace_l2_accuracy_xl).
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/timing_shape/*.ncu-rep
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/timing_shape/label_*_*.json
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/timing_shape/label_run_manifest_*_*.json
# Same per-launch sidecar pattern for the bulk sm_86 NCU re-capture
# sweep cohort cells at trace_l2_accuracy_lg + correctness_shape.
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/trace_l2_accuracy_lg/*.ncu-rep
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/trace_l2_accuracy_lg/label_*_*.json
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/trace_l2_accuracy_lg/label_run_manifest_*_*.json
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/correctness_shape/*.ncu-rep
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/correctness_shape/label_*_*.json
data/local_labels/sm_86/*/correctness_shape/label_run_manifest_*_*.json

